{
  "about": "The system's Window menu in every app (docs/adr/0016-windows.mdx, decision 12; docs/adr/0021-menu-bar.mdx): WindowProbe as Allo with the session's shell, in Spanish at 1 (1280 × 720, the work area between the top bar and the dock 1280 × 636 from y 28). The bar ends with Ventana: Minimizar (Super+M), Zoom, Rellenar (Alt+Super+F), Centrar (Alt+Super+C) and Mover y redimensionar with the halves, the quarters, the arrangements and Volver al tamaño anterior, each with the chord the compositor takes for it. Each row chosen there is the compositor's for the window, by its number (the shell's LayOutWindow, MinimizeWindow): Rellenar fills the work area within its 8 px margins, each half and quarter takes its tile, Centrar puts the window at its size (a quarter's, after one) in the middle, Volver al tamaño anterior gives back the frame it had before it was first tiled, Zoom zooms it to the work area's edges and back, and Minimizar puts it in the dock; the window keeps the keyboard, and React hears nothing. With no window active, the desktop's bar has Ventana too, every row there and none offered. (The arrangements, which need a second window, are the scene's tests.)",
  "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
  "module": "WindowProbe",
  "window": [
    900,
    600
  ],
  "shell": "OxyOSShell",
  "app": {
    "id": "so.oxy.allo",
    "title": "Allo"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "the window is the active one; the bar ends with the system's Ventana menu",
      "do": [
        "press",
        [
          600,
          300
        ]
      ],
      "allow_unchanged": true,
      "expect": {
        "window_rect": [
          190,
          46,
          900,
          600
        ],
        "focus_surface": 1,
        "texts": [
          "active yes, zoomed no, full screen no"
        ],
        "in_shell": {
          "texts": [
            "Allo",
            "Ventana"
          ]
        },
        "react": {
          "touchStart@settings-page": 1,
          "touchEnd@settings-page": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
